{"real": false, "dur": 88.17, "sent": [{"start": 0.4, "end": 5.02, "text": "The frame is simply everything I can reuse, whatever language I’m teaching.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 0.4}, {"w": "frame", "s": 0.78}, {"w": "is", "s": 1.17}, {"w": "simply", "s": 1.55}, {"w": "everything", "s": 1.94}, {"w": "I", "s": 2.32}, {"w": "can", "s": 2.71}, {"w": "reuse,", "s": 3.09}, {"w": "whatever", "s": 3.48}, {"w": "language", "s": 3.86}, {"w": "I’m", "s": 4.25}, {"w": "teaching.", "s": 4.63}]}, {"start": 5.37, "end": 16.9, "text": "That includes the lesson pages, four types of exercise for sentences, words, set phrases and sounds, the different difficulty levels, bonus material, situation activities, unit tasks and the learning map.", "words": [{"w": "That", "s": 5.37}, {"w": "includes", "s": 5.75}, {"w": "the", "s": 6.13}, {"w": "lesson", "s": 6.52}, {"w": "pages,", "s": 6.9}, {"w": "four", "s": 7.29}, {"w": "types", "s": 7.67}, {"w": "of", "s": 8.06}, {"w": "exercise", "s": 8.44}, {"w": "for", "s": 8.83}, {"w": "sentences,", "s": 9.21}, {"w": "words,", "s": 9.6}, {"w": "set", "s": 9.98}, {"w": "phrases", "s": 10.37}, {"w": "and", "s": 10.75}, {"w": "sounds,", "s": 11.13}, {"w": "the", "s": 11.52}, {"w": "different", "s": 11.9}, {"w": "difficulty", "s": 12.29}, {"w": "levels,", "s": 12.67}, {"w": "bonus", "s": 13.06}, {"w": "material,", "s": 13.44}, {"w": "situation", "s": 13.83}, {"w": "activities,", "s": 14.21}, {"w": "unit", "s": 14.6}, {"w": "tasks", "s": 14.98}, {"w": "and", "s": 15.37}, {"w": "the", "s": 15.75}, {"w": "learning", "s": 16.13}, {"w": "map.", "s": 16.52}]}, {"start": 17.25, "end": 22.25, "text": "For Chinese, the activities keep their structure, but the texts and words change.", "words": [{"w": "For", "s": 17.25}, {"w": "Chinese,", "s": 17.64}, {"w": "the", "s": 18.02}, {"w": "activities", "s": 18.41}, {"w": "keep", "s": 18.79}, {"w": "their", "s": 19.18}, {"w": "structure,", "s": 19.56}, {"w": "but", "s": 19.95}, {"w": "the", "s": 20.33}, {"w": "texts